---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Commercial use of node-opcua" 
  description="Information regarding commercial usage, SLAs, certified builds, consulting, and support contracts for node-opcua."
>
  <section class="commercial-section">
    <div class="container commercial-container">
      <h1 class="commercial-title">Commercial use of node-opcua</h1>
      
      <div class="commercial-content">
        <p class="intro-text">
          node-opcua is MIT-licensed. You can use it in commercial products with no obligation to Sterfive.
        </p>
        
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <p class="highlight-title">Many industrial users go a step further and engage Sterfive for one or more of:</p>
          <ul class="commercial-services">
            <li>Support contracts and SLAs</li>
            <li>Certified builds for regulated environments</li>
            <li>Custom development and integration consulting</li>
            <li>Commercial modules (OPC UA Modeler, OPC UA for Node-RED, PubSub, GDS, and others) built on top of node-opcua</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <p class="routing-text">
          Sterfive is the company that builds and maintains node-opcua. The commercial portfolio, pricing, and contact paths live on sterfive.com.
        </p>
        
        <div class="commercial-ctas">
          <a href="https://www.sterfive.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary">
            Go to sterfive.com <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://support.sterfive.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
            Go to support.sterfive.com <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
        
        <hr class="separator" />
        
        <div class="sustain-section">
          <p class="sustain-text">
            Looking to sustain the open project instead of buying commercial support? See the GitHub Sponsors page.
          </p>
          <a href="https://github.com/sponsors/node-opcua" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-tertiary-button">
            Sponsor node-opcua <span class="arrow">&rarr;</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .commercial-section {
    padding: 6rem 0;
    min-height: 70vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .commercial-container {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .commercial-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, #ffffff, #cbd5e1);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  }
  .commercial-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
  }
  .intro-text {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: #fff;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .highlight-box {
    background-color: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .highlight-title {
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }
  .commercial-services {
    list-style-type: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }
  .commercial-services li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .commercial-services li::before {
    content: "·";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 0.75;
    top: 0.15rem;
  }
  .routing-text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .commercial-ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .separator {
    border: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--border-color);
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }
  .sustain-section {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }
  .sustain-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }
  .btn-tertiary-button {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
    border: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
    color: var(--text-color);
  }
  .btn-tertiary-button:hover {
    border-style: solid;
    border-color: var(--text-muted);
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  }
  .arrow {
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .btn:hover .arrow {
    transform: translateX(3px);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .commercial-ctas {
      flex-direction: column;
      width: 100%;
      gap: 1rem;
    }
    .btn {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
